00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:17.620
If you are the democratic establishment and
your goal is not so much about, well we really

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:23.360
want Joe to be the nominee versus we really
want Amy to be the nominee.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:27.870
If your goal is just, we don't want it to
be Bernie and probably we don't want it to

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:32.250
be Warren, you have an asymmetrical path to
victory.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:37.990
It is very similar, and I use this analogy
last week, if you were in a football game

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:44.730
and you were up seven points, you don't need
to prevent the other team from scoring.

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:47.250
You just need to prevent a touchdown.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:51.569
The other team needs a touchdown in order
to win.

00:04:51.569 --> 00:04:54.060
So you have asymmetrical strategies.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:59.270
The authentic needs to get over the goal line
and get a touchdown because they're down seven

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:05.710
the defense can actually play a defense where
you would even allow some gains and a field

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:10.750
goal potentially, but you've got to make damn
sure that there isn't a touchdown.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:15.509
That is the asymmetrical situation right now
in terms of the Progressive's versus the establishment

00:05:15.509 --> 00:05:16.660
in the democratic primary.

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:22.690
Uh, the, the, as the cap to my Sharpie flies
off, um, if you want to prevent Bernie from

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:28.330
being the nominee, you know that super delegates
get to vote on the second round at the convention.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:32.810
You merely need to prevent Bernie from getting
enough delegates to secure the nomination.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:37.800
So it doesn't really matter if the delegates
all go to Biden or Amy or if they split enough

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:41.380
delegates to prevent Bernie from winning on
the first ballot.

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:47.110
Your path is simply to keep this thing going
and keep people picking up enough delegates

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.669
that Bernie doesn't get them all.

